This Services Agreement (this "Agreement" {{def: agreement}}) is made between {{party: acme}}
and {{party: beta}} (together with its affiliates, the {{side: client-group}}).

<!-- A comment is never rendered. -->

# Definitions {#definitions}

"Services" {{def: services}} means the services described in {{attach: schedule-a}}.

"Business Day" {{def:}} means a day on which banks are open in Delaware.

# Services {#services}

## Performance {#performance}

{{party: acme, label=The Provider}} shall perform the {{term: services}} on each
{{term: business-day, label=business day}}, and shall:

- keep records of all work performed {#records}
- notify the Client of any delay, including: {#delay}
  - the cause of the delay {#delay-cause}
  - its expected duration
- comply with the policies in {{attach: exhibit-1, label=the price list}}.

The steps of the escalation procedure are:

7. contact the account manager
7. contact the service director {#escalation-director}

## Changes

A change under item {{ref: delay-cause}} or step {{ref: escalation-director}} is made in
writing under Section {{ref: performance}}.

# Fees {#fees}

The Client shall pay {{money: 10000, currency=USD}} per month, and {{money: 1234.5, currency=EUR}}
for setup, within {{duration: 30, unit=D}} of {{date: 2026-07-01}}. The Provider's VAT number is
{{field: DE123456789, type=vat-id}}.

| Service | Fee | Notes |
|:---|---:|:---:|
| Hosting | {{money: 500, currency=USD}} | per *month* |
| Support | {{money: 250.75, currency=USD}} | see {{ref: fees}} |

> The fees are fixed for the first year.

